---
title: Pasta Bolognese
servings: 4
prep time: 15 min
cook time: 1 hour
difficulty: medium
course: main
tags:
  - italian
  - pasta
  - classic
equipment:
  - Dutch oven
  - oven
---

= Soffritto

Heat @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #Dutch oven{}. Add @onion{1}, @carrot{1}, and @celery stalk{1}, all finely diced. Cook over medium heat for ~{6%min} until softened.

= Meat Sauce

Add @minced beef{500%g} and cook until browned, breaking up any lumps. Pour in @dry white wine{120%ml} and cook for ~{3%minutes} until evaporated.

Stir in @canned tomatoes{400%g} and @tomato paste{1%tbsp}. Season with @salt{} and @black pepper{}. Transfer to #oven{} and simmer for ~{45%minutes}.

= Pasta

Cook @spaghetti{400%g} in a #large pot{} of salted boiling water until al dente.

Drain and toss with the bolognese sauce. Serve with @parmesan cheese{} grated on top.
